      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "一味向前看——\n那样的强大，我并没有……。\n即便如此——",
      "source_fingerprint": "8145298b2d991f0309bab1453c090629232db66e6098ec19c4ce25a076991f42",
