    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4323bb2f303418107498b6c4",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不再像这次一样到最后关头才决定出战，\n下次从一开始\n就以和北部玄驹竞争为目标。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ed97baff473e33db4fe638c260f3b8eeaa748b99732f596c420de49bdd892269",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
